nodes.statement:
Fix $k \in \mathbb{N}$.
Every set of positive upper Banach density $A\subset N$ has a shift $A-t$ which contains a sumset
\begin{equation}

B^{\oplus k}:=\left\{\sum_{n\in F}n:F\subset B\text{ with }|F|=k\right\}
\end{equation}
for some integer $t \ge 0$ and some infinite set $B \subset \mathbb{N}$.
